sa or something, but there's no such statement. So, it's not necessarily true.\n\nSimilarly for 4, Gary being descendant of Julie would require the opposite.\n\nFor 3, no common descendant mentioned.\n\nSo, only 2 is definitely true.\n\nTherefore, the answer is 2.","format":"xai-responses-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"","format":"xai-responses-v1","id":"rs_14acfaa5-afc4-5bca-3df7-8fe70cd42a9d","index":1}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":261,"completion_tokens":5519,"total_tokens":5780,"cost":0.01405655,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":64,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.01405655,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.00025905,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0137975},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":5267,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}